<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Process.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Process.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Integrated Process Equipment Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- analysts Jay Deahna and Steven Pelayo said in a note that company's fundamentals are improving fast.</p>
<p>-- cited improving chemcial mechanical planarization equipment demand in general and rapidly increasing interest in company's new 776 product.</p>
<p>-- said they expected the company's June and September quarter results to drive the stock to their $30 price target in four months or less. stock was up 2-3/16 to 22-3/4.</p>
</text>
